    <string name="about_section_what">WHAT IT DOES</string>
    <string name="about_what_body">Lay a small object on the screen, drag the two red markers to its edges and read the span in millimetres and inches at the same time. Calibrate once against a bank card and the scale stays correct on this device. Every span can be named and saved for later.</string>
    <string name="about_section_privacy">PRIVACY POLICY</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">All measurements and settings stay on this device. The app has no internet access and collects nothing.</string>
